    "created_at": "2019-01-29T13:20:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-01-29T13:20:47Z",
    "body": "Oh this is about `perspective` property... I was talking about `-webkit-transform: perspective()`.\r\n\r\nAnyway, there are several questions regarding the numbers:\r\n* Does the number exclude forms like `-webkit-perspective: 500; perspective: 500px;` (i.e. authors provide a standard version while using quirks for non-standard property at the same time)?\r\n* Does the number exclude zero, e.g. `perspective: 0` (which is a valid `<length>` per spec)?\r\n\r\nIf the number currently doesn't take them into account, then there is probably a good chance that the usage being high may not really be a problem for removing it.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
