    "body": "@foolip (also cc @lilles / @andruud): some volunteer sent a patch to implement the quirk in Firefox (in https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1362499)\n\nIt's the path of least resistance, and we'd add some WPTs for this. That said, given we haven't found ~any compat impact of this in the wild for the last few years I thought it'd be good to check with y'all before just taking the patch.\n\nI _think_ chromium use counters show that usage of this has significantly gone down, is removing this quirk more easily doable now?",
